It could be that the asedirector has become a runaway process. Try killing
the asedirector with a SIGKILL. Normally the asedirector is running on only
one node in your cluster. After you kill the asedirector a new one should be
started automatically by the other ASE services. Now that you have a fresh
asedirector try starting the asemgr again.




