supported.
RSX 11M+ was a SMP operating system. The PDP 11/74 MP could have as many as
4 processors.  David Cutler used at least one to write VMS V0.x
VMS and Unix have the same parent Multics.

I missed RSTS/E but I did work with Mumps-11 and DSM.

